{
  "name": "deep-brand",
  "description": "Dark counterpart of soft-depth for brands with a strong primary color: the product window sits on a deep backdrop lit by brand-colored glows, so a light interface gets maximum contrast. Captions use dark glass with white text. Colors are neutral defaults; a brand overrides them with brand.demoColors[\"deep-brand\"].",
